<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador has deployed roughly 1,000 troops to Haiti after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince kidnapped four Salvadoran aviation technicians and the bodies recovered were not those hostages. Haitian gangs launched a major attack on UN-backed troops, causing dozens of casualties. The Dominican Republic announced it will not tolerate any gangs within 20km of its border and reinforced its southern frontier to prevent spillover. Heavy rains triggered flooding and landslides that killed four people, adding a humanitarian shock to the security crisis. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPV1FsRG13WUFFS1B2SUUwZ0prZzlWX1I2NE9jT2pqY0w3RWNoMG14NVIyWlVrNG4yZ0x0WFBBRXRFQkRaY0U1ZWlhdzRqZHZWWWhyRG9MNzBkQllQejE3U2RteWF1VU1nWk1FS1YtakRKSk9HV0otNGNlUUhSRVp4WlRZMWx4TmloUkF5anlWS0JPTWNTN1cxQVpJOTBhQ283dTBvMlJFZnlUUGVKQWNqdDFRZnVFS0Z0WnFxUktPR1R4VDFW?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPX3A0Z2dMclpLeWNSOTRfeVh3cXhTMWhnRnpwNEhnaXZXWl8tV3BKOFFZN25pWWtYS3NlNnRkd3FET0RhWlhPcFVNckQ1RW5sMldrRjQtMzY0ZDhJaXlDeDBsT1NsUF95NjFqRUFldXV2S055SjZkUjh1d2c2a3cwQjQwd1FEU1JNY1dXR3pwdUl1Uks0aWpUSXN6RFM0QzJ6VFBqb0F2YUhJa2ZfQ0ZOWHM0Mk5LckRv?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPN3N0enNCa0pOSjQzZ0ZLcmJtZEdvY0JFNl95NkRWSkZOUGkwb0FLTmRCOWRGVEthTE1OZ0NHbjZkOUNMRFA3LU8tR1NSUVFwRVYybVl4N28ydjRGVU9sWUFWdF8xZE0zZzRwekE4UHpURnFLZjNmVnRCNURtOFhaOTh2bmQtcEN1MXdnS05HYVg3OVNQVDVVOFVUclVFMzQ0N1h0dnVydmsyT2hBNFY2bzFkd0xfNElWWGc4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Toronto Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, 